{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":24,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["两筐无花果的比喻"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["巴比伦王尼布甲尼撒从耶路撒冷把约雅敬的儿子犹大王耶哥尼雅、犹大的官员、技工和工匠掳到巴比伦以后，耶和华使我看见两筐无花果放在祂的殿前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["一筐无花果极好，好像初熟的果子；另一筐则坏得不能吃。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和华问我：“耶利米啊，你看见什么？”我回答说：“无花果。好的好极了，坏的坏得不能吃。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和华便对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["“以色列的上帝耶和华这样说，‘那些从这里被掳到迦勒底的犹大人在我眼中是好无花果。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我要眷顾他们，带他们回到这里。我要使他们兴起，不再毁灭他们；我要栽培他们，不再铲除他们；"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我要赐给他们一颗心，使他们认识我是耶和华。他们要做我的子民，我要做他们的上帝，因为他们必全心全意地归向我。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["耶和华又说，‘犹大王西底迦及其官员，以及留在耶路撒冷和埃及的人在我眼中就像坏得不能吃的无花果。我必丢弃他们，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["使他们的遭遇令天下万国惊惧。在我流放他们去的地方，他们必受凌辱、嘲笑、讥讽和咒诅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我要使刀剑、饥荒和瘟疫临到他们，直到他们在我赐给他们和他们祖先的土地上彻底灭亡。’”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/24.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/25.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/23.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}